{"availability":"available","full":"benavlabs/crudadmin","name":"crudadmin","description":"Modern admin interface for FastAPI with built-in authentication, event tracking, and security features","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":456,"forks":32,"created":"2024-05-12T21:24:43Z","updated":"2026-10-08T20:47:44Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://benavlabs.github.io/crudadmin/","topics":["admin","admin-dashboard","admin-panel","backend","crud","fastapi","pydantic","pydantic-v2","python","sqlalchemy"],"demo":"https://benavlabs.github.io/crudadmin/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:04.794Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:04.794Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:04.794Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T03:37:04.794Z","stars":456,"forks":32}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Modern admin interface for FastAPI with built-in authentication, event tracking, and security features","CRUDAdmin is a robust admin interface generator for FastAPI applications, offering secure authentication, comprehensive event tracking, and essential monitoring features. Built with FastCRUD and HTMX, it helps you create production-ready admin panels with minimal configuration.","\\[!IMPORTANT\\] v0.6.0: Authentication now runs on crudauth. Upgrading signs every admin out once, logout is a POST, the Memcached session backend is gone, and new admins aren't superusers by default. Read the v0.6.0 release notes before upgrading."],"features":["🔒 Session Management: Sessions in memory, Redis or the admin database, built on crudauth, with a Sessions page to sign devices out","🛡️ Built-in Security: CSRF protection, login lockout, password confirmation before admin-account changes, IP allowlists, HTTPS enforcement, and secure session cookies (HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Strict)","👥 Roles: Superusers manage admin accounts and see the event log; other admins work with your models","📝 Event Tracking & Audit Logs: Comprehensive audit trails for all admin actions with user attribution","📊 Auto-generated Interface: Creates admin UI directly from your SQLAlchemy models with intelligent field detection"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/benavlabs/crudadmin/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d695e959ea52afdb9dd703b2da40f34360c1faedebbdad599b13525b7cfe493f","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:04.951Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:04.951Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Modern admin interface for FastAPI with built-in authentication, event tracking, and security features","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/benavlabs/crudadmin/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"🛡️ Built-in Security: CSRF protection, login lockout, password confirmation before admin-account changes, IP allowlists, HTTPS enforcement, and secure session cookies (HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Strict)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/benavlabs/crudadmin/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Sessions, CSRF tokens and login-lockout counters live in one of three backends.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/benavlabs/crudadmin/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"d695e959ea52afdb9dd703b2da40f34360c1faedebbdad599b13525b7cfe493f","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/benavlabs/crudadmin/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:04.951Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T20:47:44Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/benavlabs/crudadmin/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:04.952Z","hash":"d695e959ea52afdb9dd703b2da40f34360c1faedebbdad599b13525b7cfe493f","originalBytes":9697,"storedBytes":9697,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["admin","session","crudadmin","redis","key","fastapi","get","create","import","secret","sessions","async","backend","database","production","secure","user","allowed","authentication","event","features","inter